Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set the sails! Top two!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find the next island! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we rest for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a little too relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, that attitude isn't going\Nto get us very far on these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I want to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waves look a little too strange\Nfor comfort, so it's back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything for you, Nami dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something in the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the breeze? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are sea monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to be here, Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.09,0:01:09.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,640)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord2.8\3c&H0E0E11&\c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,478)\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)\t(3812,3854,\1a&HFF&)}Marine Headquarters\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.09,0:01:09.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(476,478)\fscx150\fscy150\bord0\blur0.8\b600\pos(960,640)}Marine Headquarters\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that already, you imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you where the hell he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since his bicycle is missing\Ntoo, he probably went to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact the five Elder Stars. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon me, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should expect this\Nsort of thing by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's likely just sightseeing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think he should show a\Nbit more respect for his position?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have him wondering\Nabout whenever he sees fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admiral Aokiji is one of Navy Headquarters'\Nultimate powerhouses, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I'm surprised to see\Na bounty on this kid's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His whole family's full of troublemakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:01:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
